{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2021-12-08 11:06:00', 'title': 'PLEX SYSTEMS ACHIEVES INTERNATIONAL INFORMATION SECURITY STANDARDS ISO 27001 CERTIFICATION', 'text': 'TROY, MICH., DEC. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 PLEX SYSTEMS , A ROCKWELL AUTOMATION COMPANY AND THE LEADER IN CLOUD-DELIVERED SMART MANUFACTURING SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY HAS PASSED THE ISO/IEC 27001:2013 CERTIFICATION AUDIT FOR ITS SMART MANUFACTURING PLATFORM.'}